  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Ben is at Tom's house. They have a big toy box. They play. Ben has a helicopter. It is blue and small. Tom has a red truck. \"Go, truck, go!\" says Tom. \"Where is my favorite toy?\" asks Ben.",
      "Tom looks in the box. He finds a green monster. It has two big eyes. \"Hello, Monster!\" says Ben. \"I want food!\" says Tom. Ben laughs. Tom is the monster. \"Monster wants an apple,\" he says. \"And a banana!\" says Tom.",
      "Mom comes in with fruit. It is an apple and a banana. \"Here you are,\" says Mom. Tom puts them on the floor. Pip is a dog. Pip comes to the monster. Snap! Pip eats the apple and the banana. \"Oh no!\" says Tom. The monster is sad. Mom gives them a pear."
    ],
    "summary": "Ben plays with Tom and his toys. The toy monster wants an apple and a banana, but Pip takes them.",
